{"person":"person:canon:duanyanqing","as_name":"青袍客","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":"place:canon:shiwu","believed_by":["person:canon:baodingdi","person:canon:zhongling","person:canon:duanyu","person:canon:muwanqing"],"ch":[8,8],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[8,43,12,28,"6c80100d142f0919"],[8,55,12,19,"b4539d7daa3200b5"],[8,56,35,50,"e07152ecb5fc80f0"]],"note":"保定帝与钟灵在石屋前只见到这位青袍怪客；保定帝听他低声自报来历后才认出真身，段誉、木婉清与钟灵至回末仍不知其名"}
{"person":"person:canon:duanyanqing","as_name":"延庆太子","kind":"title","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":["person:canon:baodingdi","person:canon:duanzhengchun","person:canon:daobaifeng","person:canon:gaoshengtai","person:canon:batianshi","person:canon:huangmeiseng","person:canon:huahegen","person:canon:fanhua"],"ch":[8,8],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[8,97,57,65,"81d60f4c48da0ca5"],[8,98,97,109,"de7f9ea92accb084"]],"note":"保定帝凭一阳指断定石屋前的青袍客就是失踪多年的上德帝之子；段正淳起初疑是冒名，随后接受；保定帝嘱此事只许告诉华赫艮与范骅两人"}
{"person":"person:canon:huahegen","as_name":"华阿根","kind":"alias","when":null,"where":null,"believed_by":[],"ch":[8,8],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[8,131,0,11,"ebf14243fe1df711"]],"note":"他未发迹时的旧名，居官后嫌俗改作赫艮；除范骅与巴天石外，旁人几乎不晓得他的来历"}
{"person":"person:canon:baodingdi","as_name":"便装出行的路人","kind":"disguise","when":null,"where":"place:canon:dalicheng","believed_by":["*"],"ch":[8,8],"tag":"text","b":"text","e":[[8,116,5,17,"cdae88ba24f65cb4"],[8,116,27,31,"cdae88ba24f65cb4"]],"note":"傍晚他换便装、压低帽檐独自出宫，街上百姓没有认出皇帝"}
